WEBVTT

00:19:25.246 --> 00:19:30.246
so two males are wanting perhaps,
I don't know,

00:19:30.579 --> 00:19:34.454
to take bananas from a high ranking
one and neither of them

00:19:34.454 --> 00:19:38.704
on their own could do it. And so they gang
up. And that's a temporary alliance.

00:19:39.413 --> 00:19:41.788
And I guess I'm trying to visualize
how this happens.

00:19:42.246 --> 00:19:44.496
You know, when chimps get together
and form an alliance,

00:19:44.496 --> 00:19:46.746
whether it's temporary or more lasting,

00:19:47.329 --> 00:19:49.663
is there a this is going to
be a strange question,

00:19:49.663 --> 00:19:54.121
but I'll give you a sense of how I think
is there is there a workplace analog

00:19:54.579 --> 00:19:58.121
so, you know, to chimps coordinate like
they're working on an assembly line.

00:19:58.163 --> 00:19:59.663
Does it look more like a farm?

00:19:59.913 --> 00:20:02.829
Do you see them in an office with
cubicles or am I stretching,